  "__class__": "Meeting",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": "00:15:12.480",
      "end": "00:15:13.940",
      "text": "Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": "00:15:13.940",
      "end": "00:15:16.840",
      "text": "I'd like to call to order the eight special meeting"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": "00:15:16.840",
      "end": "00:15:20.150",
      "text": "of the Corporate Services Committee."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": "00:15:20.150",
      "end": "00:15:21.260",
      "text": "Please check the city website,"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": "00:15:21.260",
      "end": "00:15:24.220",
      "text": "traditional meeting detail information."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": "00:15:24.220",
      "end": "00:15:27.090",
      "text": "Meetings can be viewed via live stream"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": "00:15:27.090",
      "end": "00:15:30.810",
      "text": "on YouTube and the city website."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": "00:15:30.810",
      "end": "00:15:33.340",
      "text": "The city of London is situated on the traditional lands"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": "00:15:33.340",
      "end": "00:15:38.740",
      "text": "of the Anishwabak, Haudenosaunee, Leno Peiwok,"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": "00:15:38.740",
      "end": "00:15:42.430",
      "text": "and the Adnawon Run tribes."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": "00:15:42.430",
      "end": "00:15:44.430",
      "text": "We honor and respect the history, languages,"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": "00:15:44.430",
      "end": "00:15:47.140",
      "text": "and culture of the diverse indigenous people"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": "00:15:47.140",
      "end": "00:15:49.750",
      "text": "call this territory home."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": "00:15:49.750",
      "end": "00:15:52.550",
      "text": "The city of London is currently home to many First Nations,"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": "00:15:52.550",
      "end": "00:15:55.560",
      "text": "M\u00e9tis and Inuit today."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": "00:15:55.560",
      "end": "00:15:58.160",
      "text": "As representatives of the people of the city of London,"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": "00:15:58.160",
      "end": "00:16:00.540",
      "text": "we are grateful to have the opportunity to work"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": "00:16:00.540",
      "end": "00:16:04.740",
      "text": "and live in this territory."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": "00:16:04.740",
      "end": "00:16:10.560",
      "text": "Colleagues, we have online,"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": "00:16:10.560",
      "end": "00:16:15.360",
      "text": "Councilor Stevenson, Councilor Raman,"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": "00:16:15.360",
      "end": "00:16:18.810",
      "text": "and by phone we have Councilor Van Mirbergen,"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": "00:16:18.810",
      "end": "00:16:20.580",
      "text": "so we do have quorum."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": "00:16:20.580",
      "end": "00:16:23.250",
      "text": "And colleagues, I do not take any offense to the fact"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": "00:16:23.250",
      "end": "00:16:27.910",
      "text": "that none of you have joined me in council today."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": "00:16:27.910",
      "end": "00:16:32.190",
      "text": "We will begin with disclosures of peccini or interest."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": "00:16:32.190",
      "end": "00:16:40.340",
      "text": "We have any disclosures of peccuniary interest."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": "00:16:40.340",
      "end": "00:16:42.450",
      "text": "Seeing or hearing none, we'll proceed."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": "00:16:42.450",
      "end": "00:16:46.460",
      "text": "We'll move right on to consent items."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": "00:16:46.460",
      "end": "00:16:48.910",
      "text": "We have no consent items."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": "00:16:48.910",
      "end": "00:16:52.990",
      "text": "We'll move to scheduled items."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": "00:16:52.990",
      "end": "00:16:56.160",
      "text": "We have no scheduled items."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": "00:16:56.160",
      "end": "00:17:00.850",
      "text": "So we moved to number four items for direction, 4.1,"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": "00:17:00.850",
      "end": "00:17:04.830",
      "text": "2024, debenture issue update."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": "00:17:04.830",
      "end": "00:17:13.090",
      "text": "We have a mover and a seconder for that motion."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": "00:17:13.090",
      "end": "00:17:16.230",
      "text": "Recognizing Councilor Stevenson as a mover"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": "00:17:16.230",
      "end": "00:17:22.850",
      "text": "and a seconder, Councilor Raman, thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": "00:17:22.850",
      "end": "00:17:27.110",
      "text": "Now move to any questions at this time,"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": "00:17:27.110",
      "end": "00:17:39.490",
      "text": "and we can open it up to Ms. Barbone if there are any questions."
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": "00:17:39.490",
      "end": "00:17:47.420",
      "text": "Seeing or hearing none, move to vote on this motion."
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": "00:17:47.420",
      "end": "00:17:49.190",
      "text": "All those in favor?"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": "00:17:49.190",
      "end": "00:17:51.030",
      "text": "Oh, sorry."
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": "00:17:51.030",
      "end": "00:17:54.520",
      "text": "Bear with me for a moment."
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": "00:17:54.520",
      "end": "00:18:05.670",
      "text": "We'll vote through e-scribe."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": "00:18:05.670",
      "end": "00:18:28.140",
      "text": "All vote, yes."
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": "00:18:28.140",
      "end": "00:18:37.480",
      "text": "Chair votes, yes."
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": "00:18:37.480",
      "end": "00:18:44.040",
      "text": "Closing the vote, motion carries, 4-0."
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": "00:18:44.040",
      "end": "00:18:44.860",
      "text": "Thank you, clerk."
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": "00:18:44.860",
      "end": "00:18:49.960",
      "text": "We'll move on to deferred matters and additional business."
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": "00:18:49.960",
      "end": "00:18:52.300",
      "text": "Have none."
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": "00:18:52.300",
      "end": "00:18:58.760",
      "text": "We have no matters of confidential for discussion."
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": "00:18:58.760",
      "end": "00:19:03.400",
      "text": "We'll move on for adjournment to Councilor Stevenson."
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": "00:19:03.400",
      "end": "00:19:04.540",
      "text": "I'll move to adjourn."
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": "00:19:04.540",
      "end": "00:19:06.400",
      "text": "Oh, thank you, Councilor Van Buren."
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": "00:19:06.400",
      "end": "00:19:07.640",
      "text": "You'll second that."
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": "00:19:07.640",
      "end": "00:19:08.610",
      "text": "I'll second."
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": "00:19:08.610",
      "end": "00:19:10.400",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": "00:19:10.400",
      "end": "00:19:11.310",
      "text": "Meeting is adjourned."
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": "00:19:11.310",
      "end": "00:19:13.160",
      "text": "Thank you, sorry."
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": "00:19:13.160",
      "end": "00:19:13.950",
      "text": "Thank you, Chair."
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": "00:19:13.950",
      "end": "00:19:15.460",
      "text": "We have to vote on that."
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": "00:19:15.460",
      "end": "00:19:18.990",
      "text": "Go anywhere."
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": "00:19:18.990",
      "end": "00:19:25.430",
      "text": "Oh, yes."
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": "00:19:25.430",
      "end": "00:19:28.980",
      "text": "Chair votes, yes."
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": "00:19:28.980",
      "end": "00:19:33.720",
      "text": "Closing the vote, motion carries."
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": "00:19:33.720",
      "end": "00:19:35.260",
      "text": "Thank you, colleagues."
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": "00:19:35.260",
      "end": "00:19:38.820",
      "text": "We are now adjourned."
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": "00:19:38.820",
      "end": "00:19:45.770",
      "text": "Take it personally that no one came to your meeting today."
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": "00:19:45.770",
      "end": "00:19:46.890",
      "text": "Thank you, Councilor Van Buren."
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": "00:19:46.890",
      "end": "00:19:49.050",
      "text": "We'll take that under consideration."
    }
  ],
